/-!
# Finite Fourier control of the actual passive children

The literal data are a Fourier profile update of one fixed arithmetic
record. That record is constructed from the same unmodulated profile
table and the same two successive retained-slot maps. Its arithmetic
mask, exhaustive row predicate, inverse profile and characters are
exactly the ones in the actual passive calibration.

The existing selected children are passed to `childFiniteControl`.
Neither a new capacity choice nor a finished finite-control input is
used. The family radii are the ones already proved for that same
passive production.
-/

noncomputable section
open scoped Classical BigOperators NumberField nonZeroDivisors SchwartzMap

